{"id":"007638c1acc7d921","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-one-one-reducibility.md","title":"One-one Reducibility","display":"df-one-one-reducibility — One-one Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-one-one-reducibility","aliases":["68-df-one-one-reducibility"],"display":"df-one-one-reducibility — One-one Reducibility","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-natural-number]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"External extension; no one-one-reducibility definition located in supplied §§1-20","verification_status":"external-source-unverified","source_proof_status":"not-checked","external_verification_status":"unverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-one-one-reducibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-one-one-reducibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-one-one-reducibility — One-one Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3368c1852f2a1aa0\" href=\"?note=3368c1852f2a1aa0\" title=\"68-df-natural-number\">68-df-natural-number</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"External extension; no one-one-reducibility definition located in supplied §§1-20"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-source-unverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"external_verification_status","html":"unverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_1,\\equiv_1\">\\(\\leq_1,\\equiv_1\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leq_1 B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Longrightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leq_1 B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Longrightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_1 B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_1 B\\land B\\leq_1 A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_1 B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_1 B\\land B\\leq_1 A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原目录的一一归约接口并限制见证为一元全递归函数。本书 §13 定义 many-one reduction；§14.7 的 one-one 是无限 RE 集的枚举函数，不是本定义的来源。所供全文未定位到独立的一一归约定义，故保留外部待核验状态。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"3368c1852f2a1aa0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]。$\\leq_1,\\equiv_1$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_1,\\equiv_1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\leq_1 B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Longrightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\equiv_1 B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_1 B\\land B\\leq_1 A.","display":true}],"bytes":1424,"backlinks":[{"id":"b933761613d185b9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-one-one-reducibility]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-one-one-reducibility]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-one-one-reducibility|df-one-one-reducibility — One-one Reducibility]]"}],"outgoing":["a82d826d433dcff3","3368c1852f2a1aa0"]}